'''Rathalos''' (リオレウス '''Rioreusu''') is an enemy that only appears in the [[Monster Hunter Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 4.2 Update|Version 4.2]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Rathalos
|image = E 187.png
|appearance = [[Monster Hunter Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 2,250円 - 8,887円
}}

==Enemy==
The weaker beast out of the [[Rathian (Enemy)|two]], this "king" is easily a threat in nearly every stage he appears in!  High health, average attack, high range as well as a 25% Strengthen increase when at 75% health. Although the 25% doesn't seem like much, it can be very deadly in stages where he is at a high magnification.

==Strategy==
In the first three times you encounter Rathalos, you can easily take him down with the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] but in his fourth encounter it is recommended to bring units that outrange or work effectively against Floating.<br>
In the [[Hunt Sky And Fire Dragons! 【G Class】|final stage]], he is at his highest magnification being 350%, giving him 1,050,000 health and 24,640 damage, not counting the Strengthen increase or the Weaken effect from [[Rathian (Enemy)|Rathian]]! [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|Anti-Floating]] units are practically required to beat the final encounter.

